WEBVTT

00:00:01.080 --> 00:00:03.210
Lately, lots of people...

00:00:03.210 --> 00:00:06.230
...have been illegally acquiring television shows.

00:00:06.230 --> 00:00:08.440
If you don't have permission from the show's rights-holders...

00:00:08.440 --> 00:00:11.520
...getting bootlegs from the Internet or elsewhere...

00:00:11.520 --> 00:00:13.940
...is illegal!

00:00:13.970 --> 00:00:15.640
Be careful, okay?

00:00:24.710 --> 00:00:26.200
Boring.

00:00:26.200 --> 00:00:29.060
I'm sick of playing tag.

00:00:30.410 --> 00:00:31.630
That boy...

00:00:36.130 --> 00:00:38.360
Kenta Kajiwara!

00:00:38.360 --> 00:00:42.150
The parallel subject who produces abnormal amounts of backfeeding when charged,

00:00:42.150 --> 00:00:46.040
the class Z target!

00:00:47.570 --> 00:00:52.030
Kiseki wa genjitsu no tonari ni aru

00:00:47.570 --> 00:00:52.030
Miracles are right beside reality

00:00:52.030 --> 00:00:55.120
Kanarazu aru

00:00:52.030 --> 00:00:55.120
They're there for sure

00:01:00.880 --> 00:01:06.470
Chiisana tameiki shinpai dakara

00:01:00.880 --> 00:01:06.470
I heave a tiny sigh because I'm worried

00:01:06.840 --> 00:01:12.380
Ushiro sugata mimamotteirunda yo

00:01:06.840 --> 00:01:12.380
From behind you, I'm watching over you

00:01:12.730 --> 00:01:18.320
Kirai dattara konna koto iwanai yo

00:01:12.730 --> 00:01:18.320
I wouldn't be saying this if I hated you

00:01:18.530 --> 00:01:24.500
Kitto hito wa hitori janai

00:01:18.530 --> 00:01:24.500
I know it must be true that no man is an island

00:01:22.970 --> 00:01:25.910
Hitori janai

00:01:22.970 --> 00:01:25.910
You're not alone

00:01:26.590 --> 00:01:32.180
Tatoeba sotto yubisaki ni fureru omoi

00:01:26.590 --> 00:01:32.180
For example, if you gently brush those hopes with your fingertips

00:01:32.560 --> 00:01:38.120
Tatoeba taisetsu na toki wo wasurenaide

00:01:32.560 --> 00:01:38.120
For example, if you never forget these precious times

00:01:38.470 --> 00:01:44.060
Kakato wo motto sukoshi dake takaku agete

00:01:38.470 --> 00:01:44.060
I'll boost you up, just a little higher

00:01:44.340 --> 00:01:50.040
Mieru yo ano ko no hitomi ni utsuru hikari

00:01:44.340 --> 00:01:50.040
Look and see the light reflecting in her eyes

00:01:50.280 --> 00:01:55.910
ENERGY wa sekai no zenbu ni michiteru

00:01:50.280 --> 00:01:55.910
Filling up the whole world with energy

00:01:56.220 --> 00:02:03.700
Ima dake wa chikara wo kashite ageru yo

00:01:56.220 --> 00:02:03.700
Just for now, I'll lend my strength to you

00:02:31.080 --> 00:02:34.550
<i>I've seen the good that charging ladies do.</i>

00:02:34.550 --> 00:02:40.220
<i>She burned her arms for a reward no salary could match.</i>

00:02:40.220 --> 00:02:44.310
<i>That's why I intend to stay by her side.</i>

00:02:44.310 --> 00:02:49.230
<i>Because of her, we can still live our lives in this world.</i>

00:02:52.110 --> 00:02:55.440
Charger Division Two, Plug Cryostat.

00:02:55.440 --> 00:02:57.820
Your refresher is ready.

00:03:03.200 --> 00:03:05.830
Fight! In one strike!

00:03:03.370 --> 00:03:05.830
Fight! In one strike!

00:03:13.670 --> 00:03:18.800
The final battle is over. We don't need to fight anymore.

00:03:18.800 --> 00:03:24.430
That's right. Because we're in love.

00:03:24.430 --> 00:03:25.720
Both in body...

00:03:26.510 --> 00:03:27.680
...and soul.

00:03:27.680 --> 00:03:28.980
Milly...

00:03:28.980 --> 00:03:30.310
Silica...

00:03:31.560 --> 00:03:34.770
Since when did those supposedly flat-chested,

00:03:34.770 --> 00:03:38.690
filthy whores turn into such a lovey-dovey lesbian couple?

00:03:38.690 --> 00:03:40.400
What a way to go, Milly!

00:03:40.400 --> 00:03:43.110
So beautiful, Mistress Silica!

00:03:43.110 --> 00:03:45.490
Miracle Witch!

00:03:45.070 --> 00:03:45.660
Demon Lord Chapter: End

00:03:45.660 --> 00:03:46.330
Demon Lord Chapter: End

00:03:46.330 --> 00:03:47.490
Demon Lord Chapter: End

00:03:56.590 --> 00:03:57.630
Sentou.

00:03:58.170 --> 00:04:02.380
Charge!

00:04:08.310 --> 00:04:09.270
Sentou!

00:04:23.610 --> 00:04:24.740
Boring.

00:04:25.410 --> 00:04:26.990
Sentou...

00:04:26.990 --> 00:04:28.490
Hey everyone!

00:04:28.490 --> 00:04:31.290
Thanks for supporting us so far!

00:04:31.290 --> 00:04:32.660
Starting next episode it will be...

00:04:32.660 --> 00:04:34.580
I don't approve of dirty...

00:04:38.960 --> 00:04:40.300
Sentou.

00:04:41.670 --> 00:04:44.760
Sentou, it's me, Alesta.

00:04:44.760 --> 00:04:47.760
Please sense me, see me...

00:05:04.280 --> 00:05:07.700
I can't stand being invisible anymore!

00:05:07.700 --> 00:05:11.490
You there, Plug? Alesta?

00:05:11.490 --> 00:05:12.000
Yes!

00:05:14.000 --> 00:05:17.080
I really can't see them anymore, huh?

00:05:20.000 --> 00:05:21.590
If I have to...

00:05:22.630 --> 00:05:24.760
This is the only option left...

00:05:26.590 --> 00:05:28.390
<i>Please return to normal...</i>

00:05:28.390 --> 00:05:32.180
<i>With my... kiss of love.</i>

00:05:33.180 --> 00:05:33.930
Brother!

00:05:38.520 --> 00:05:40.150
Hakone, you're back.

00:05:40.150 --> 00:05:41.440
You too, Iono.

00:05:41.440 --> 00:05:42.400
Senny.

00:05:42.400 --> 00:05:43.360
Do you have a second?

00:05:47.410 --> 00:05:50.450
Hang on. I'm coming for you!

00:05:58.210 --> 00:06:00.040
Kenta Kajiwara

00:06:00.080 --> 00:06:01.380
Kenta?

00:06:01.380 --> 00:06:02.590
No way!

00:06:02.590 --> 00:06:04.340
I helped you overcome your problem!

00:06:04.340 --> 00:06:06.130
Why?

00:06:06.130 --> 00:06:12.060
<i>With the others, when I use my power a little, they get worn out right away after being so lively.</i>

00:06:12.060 --> 00:06:14.770
<i>It was fun to watch.</i>

00:06:20.690 --> 00:06:22.690
I'm gonna have to charge him again!

00:06:24.900 --> 00:06:26.280
Do you need anything?

00:06:26.280 --> 00:06:28.610
Brother, did something happen?

00:06:28.990 --> 00:06:31.660
You've been acting weird since yesterday.

00:06:31.660 --> 00:06:34.120
Please... tell us what's on your mind!

00:06:35.540 --> 00:06:38.370
What are you talking about, you goof?

00:06:38.370 --> 00:06:40.080
Nothing's wrong.

00:06:40.080 --> 00:06:40.830
You're lying!

00:06:40.830 --> 00:06:42.210
Hakone?

00:06:42.210 --> 00:06:43.550
Senny...

00:06:46.260 --> 00:06:47.010
Iono?

00:06:47.010 --> 00:06:50.590
I don't know what's going on, but being this lethargic...

00:06:50.590 --> 00:06:52.930
You aren't the Senny I love!

00:06:53.220 --> 00:06:54.220
Iono...

00:06:54.220 --> 00:06:55.430
After that time...

00:06:57.600 --> 00:07:03.310
When I was down and out, and I couldn't tell you about it...

00:07:03.310 --> 00:07:05.360
I heard someone's voice.

00:07:05.860 --> 00:07:09.070
No, I didn't really hear it.

00:07:09.070 --> 00:07:11.240
It was more like I felt it.

00:07:11.240 --> 00:07:13.370
The voice said, "Don't worry!"

00:07:13.370 --> 00:07:17.450
And because of that, I was able to tell you how I really felt.

00:07:17.450 --> 00:07:19.960
It's the same for me.

00:07:19.960 --> 00:07:21.920
It's strange, but at that time...

00:07:23.500 --> 00:07:27.210
It felt like somebody was pushing me forward.

00:07:27.210 --> 00:07:29.300
That's why...

00:07:29.300 --> 00:07:31.430
...I was able to confess my feelings to you.

00:07:31.430 --> 00:07:36.890
Charge!

00:07:37.140 --> 00:07:39.350
Charge!

00:07:39.680 --> 00:07:41.810
Charge!

00:07:42.060 --> 00:07:44.270
Charge!

00:07:44.520 --> 00:07:46.730
Charge!

00:07:46.730 --> 00:07:48.480
At that time, I thought,

00:07:48.480 --> 00:07:51.360
"I'm not alone."

00:07:51.360 --> 00:07:54.620
Same here. I felt that somebody was there for me.

00:07:54.620 --> 00:08:00.410
But for me, that somebody is you.

00:08:00.410 --> 00:08:01.250
Hakone.

00:08:01.250 --> 00:08:05.000
So this time, I wanted to tell you,

00:08:05.000 --> 00:08:06.710
"Don't worry!"

00:08:06.710 --> 00:08:08.460
That's right, Senny.

00:08:08.460 --> 00:08:11.630
That slap was out of love.

00:08:11.630 --> 00:08:12.430
I'm sorry.

00:08:12.430 --> 00:08:14.140
You guys...

00:08:19.600 --> 00:08:20.600
Thanks.

00:08:26.110 --> 00:08:30.320
I think I understand what our job really is, now.

00:08:30.320 --> 00:08:31.820
Fight!

00:08:31.820 --> 00:08:33.280
In one strike!!

00:08:33.280 --> 00:08:36.320
Charge!

00:08:41.790 --> 00:08:42.460
What's going on?

00:08:42.460 --> 00:08:44.080
Oh no... a blackout?

00:08:46.210 --> 00:08:49.380
This is... a large-scale blackout?

00:08:50.880 --> 00:08:52.510
Could it be? Plug!

00:08:53.680 --> 00:08:54.550
I have to go!

00:08:54.550 --> 00:08:55.550
Brother?

00:08:55.550 --> 00:08:56.390
Senny!

00:08:56.390 --> 00:08:58.100
I'll explain later!

00:09:01.220 --> 00:09:03.520
But where should I go?

00:09:07.860 --> 00:09:10.150
It's this way, Sentou!

00:09:11.780 --> 00:09:12.860
I see!

00:09:16.110 --> 00:09:18.160
<i>You owe me one, Plug.</i>

00:09:31.920 --> 00:09:33.130
Please don't you...

00:09:37.760 --> 00:09:39.180
...forget about us.

00:09:49.110 --> 00:09:50.610
<i>Why?</i>

00:09:50.610 --> 00:09:54.490
<i>The new suits are somehow protecting
me from some of the backfeed...</i>

00:09:54.490 --> 00:09:57.490
<i>...but charging seems to be failing!</i>

00:09:59.530 --> 00:10:02.620
Geez, she won't give up.

00:10:02.620 --> 00:10:03.580
Loser.

00:10:16.050 --> 00:10:17.550
What should I do?

00:10:17.550 --> 00:10:19.470
I don't know anymore!

00:10:27.350 --> 00:10:29.190
Wait, Kenta!

00:10:33.570 --> 00:10:34.650
You can't!

00:10:34.650 --> 00:10:38.360
It's winter right now, if you wade into these freezing waters...

00:10:42.830 --> 00:10:43.870
Kenta...

00:10:49.920 --> 00:10:52.170
We're almost there, Sentou!

00:10:58.130 --> 00:10:59.300
What's this?

00:11:00.890 --> 00:11:02.390
Please stop!

00:11:04.510 --> 00:11:06.060
Wait!

00:11:10.270 --> 00:11:11.980
Kenta...

00:11:13.940 --> 00:11:15.360
No, this can't be happening.

00:11:17.280 --> 00:11:18.820
No...

00:11:20.240 --> 00:11:25.410
No!

00:11:30.620 --> 00:11:31.500
Sentou?

00:11:32.250 --> 00:11:33.790
It's that one!

00:11:33.790 --> 00:11:35.210
Get a hold of yourself, Kenta!

00:11:36.210 --> 00:11:38.340
You know me?

00:11:38.340 --> 00:11:40.630
Yeah, I heard about you.

00:11:40.630 --> 00:11:42.680
From someone who's always watching you.

00:11:42.680 --> 00:11:44.010
Watching me?

00:11:44.010 --> 00:11:46.510
You may not have noticed it,

00:11:46.510 --> 00:11:49.430
but there's always someone beside you.

00:11:49.810 --> 00:11:50.600
Where?

00:11:50.600 --> 00:11:51.810
You can't see them.

00:11:51.810 --> 00:11:53.810
You may not see them, but they're always there.

00:11:54.480 --> 00:11:58.480
When you're feeling down, they'll bring you lots of energy and cheer you up.

00:11:58.480 --> 00:12:01.400
They're people who want you to be happy...

00:12:01.400 --> 00:12:05.580
...more than they want themselves to be happy.

00:12:05.580 --> 00:12:07.540
So you're not alone.

00:12:07.540 --> 00:12:09.290
I'm not alone?

00:12:09.290 --> 00:12:13.790
They told me you really love school.

00:12:13.790 --> 00:12:16.500
And you're a great kid with lots of friends.

00:12:16.920 --> 00:12:20.760
T-That's not true, I...

00:12:20.760 --> 00:12:24.220
But is there really someone watching out for me?

00:12:24.220 --> 00:12:25.260
There is.

00:12:25.260 --> 00:12:27.180
They're beside you right now.

00:12:28.680 --> 00:12:30.230
I know.

00:12:30.230 --> 00:12:33.440
Put your hand up.

00:12:33.440 --> 00:12:34.730
My hand?

00:12:39.030 --> 00:12:39.940
Kenta.

00:12:42.320 --> 00:12:43.910
It's kind of warm.

00:12:45.160 --> 00:12:46.410
Do it now!

00:12:47.120 --> 00:12:50.200
His heart's feeling better.

00:12:50.200 --> 00:12:51.330
Now's your chance.

00:12:51.330 --> 00:12:56.830
But our refreshers aren't powerful enough to charge him!

00:12:57.380 --> 00:13:00.840
You need more power than our equipment can give?

00:13:00.840 --> 00:13:04.130
Does that mean the discharge girl amplified the class Z?

00:13:04.130 --> 00:13:05.050
Damn.

00:13:06.260 --> 00:13:09.140
By the way, mister, who are you?

00:13:09.560 --> 00:13:10.350
Me?

00:13:10.350 --> 00:13:13.020
I'm just a passing university student.

00:13:13.020 --> 00:13:14.390
What should I do?

00:13:14.390 --> 00:13:18.650
If we don't move fast, those feelings will fade.

00:13:18.650 --> 00:13:20.480
Sorry for the wait!

00:13:20.480 --> 00:13:22.360
Rinko!

00:13:22.360 --> 00:13:23.990
We came to give a hand.

00:13:23.990 --> 00:13:24.900
Maako!

00:13:24.900 --> 00:13:27.120
We've done our assignments.

00:13:27.120 --> 00:13:27.990
Taako!

00:13:27.990 --> 00:13:30.120
So the battlefront is now here.

00:13:30.120 --> 00:13:30.950
Chiiko!

00:13:30.950 --> 00:13:32.790
Let's do it! Plug! Alesta!

00:13:32.790 --> 00:13:34.410
Souko!

00:13:39.670 --> 00:13:44.300
They will now put the refreshers in Series Mode.

00:13:40.670 --> 00:13:44.470
Refresher Series Mode !!

00:13:44.300 --> 00:13:47.840
What?! In Series Mode...?

00:13:50.430 --> 00:13:51.140
What's that?

00:13:52.680 --> 00:13:57.560
It's the mode where you link multiple refreshers to charge a target.

00:13:58.270 --> 00:13:59.900
Oh, that!

00:13:59.900 --> 00:14:01.980
But it's a dangerous procedure,

00:14:01.980 --> 00:14:08.410
due to the immense physical strain caused by the amount of electricity.

00:14:09.200 --> 00:14:10.950
No worries!

00:14:10.950 --> 00:14:14.040
We got the Captain's permission.

00:14:14.750 --> 00:14:15.580
Captain's permission?

00:14:16.620 --> 00:14:18.710
She said to go and help you!

00:14:18.710 --> 00:14:20.670
That's Captain Pulse for you.

00:14:20.670 --> 00:14:23.960
She said you'd just ignore the orders anyway.

00:14:23.960 --> 00:14:27.550
Of course, even without orders, we all would've come.

00:14:28.050 --> 00:14:28.890
Everyone...

00:14:28.890 --> 00:14:31.220
Alright, Refresher Series Mode!

00:14:31.220 --> 00:14:32.850
Let's try it!

00:14:32.850 --> 00:14:35.680
First, set your refreshers to mode 3, everyone.

00:14:35.680 --> 00:14:36.890
Roger!

00:14:36.890 --> 00:14:37.690
Why you...

00:14:37.690 --> 00:14:39.810
I was having fun, too.

00:14:39.810 --> 00:14:41.650
You're all pissing me off!

00:14:41.650 --> 00:14:43.780
You can't. Don't you dare interfere.

00:14:44.190 --> 00:14:49.320
The charging ladies are working together to help a parallel boy.

00:14:49.320 --> 00:14:50.740
They're doing something admirable.

00:14:50.740 --> 00:14:54.290
You just sit tight and observe what happens.

00:14:54.290 --> 00:14:57.210
Sitting back and watching isn't too hard, right?

00:14:57.210 --> 00:14:59.670
You crones again.

00:14:59.670 --> 00:15:01.920
Okay, all set!

00:15:09.430 --> 00:15:11.720
Refresher Series Mode

00:15:11.930 --> 00:15:13.850
Energy charge!

00:15:13.850 --> 00:15:15.390
240%.

00:15:16.310 --> 00:15:18.350
My hand feels cold now.

00:15:18.980 --> 00:15:21.310
Is there really someone watching me?

00:15:22.150 --> 00:15:27.320
Yeah, I think so. But somehow... I'm not sure anymore.

00:15:27.320 --> 00:15:28.650
Oh, no.

00:15:28.650 --> 00:15:31.240
Their depression levels are rising!

00:15:31.240 --> 00:15:35.700
The Series Refresher charge is only at 373%!

00:15:35.700 --> 00:15:38.330
Depression levels are still rising, fast.

00:15:38.330 --> 00:15:41.210
Charge is now 482%.

00:15:41.210 --> 00:15:43.920
We're counting on you, Plug! Alesta!

00:15:47.630 --> 00:15:49.880
Charge at 614%.

00:15:49.880 --> 00:15:53.010
Charge at 636%.

00:15:53.640 --> 00:15:55.760
Charge at 700%.

00:15:55.760 --> 00:15:56.810
Full charge!

00:15:56.810 --> 00:15:58.520
Let's go, Alesta!

00:15:59.020 --> 00:16:00.310
Fight!

00:16:00.310 --> 00:16:01.900
In one strike!!

00:16:01.900 --> 00:16:06.900
Charge!

00:16:12.740 --> 00:16:14.120
Go!

00:16:14.700 --> 00:16:16.580
Charge at 15%.

00:16:17.120 --> 00:16:19.330
Charge at 23%.

00:16:21.790 --> 00:16:23.540
Incoming backfeed!

00:16:28.880 --> 00:16:30.050
Here it comes.

00:16:52.610 --> 00:16:57.370
The backfeed from the class Z target is being absorbed!

00:16:57.370 --> 00:17:00.830
Whoa, I feel a lot better!

00:17:02.250 --> 00:17:03.920
Kenta, they're here!

00:17:05.580 --> 00:17:07.960
Do your best, Kenta.

00:17:09.840 --> 00:17:11.550
Just a bit more.

00:17:22.230 --> 00:17:24.850
It's just like you said, mister.

00:17:24.850 --> 00:17:27.520
I could see them a bit, too.

00:17:27.520 --> 00:17:28.940
That's right.

00:17:28.940 --> 00:17:30.570
Hey, that's Kenta.

00:17:30.570 --> 00:17:31.530
You're right.

00:17:31.530 --> 00:17:33.860
Hey, Kenta!

00:17:34.450 --> 00:17:34.950
Hey!

00:17:35.490 --> 00:17:36.780
What are you doing?

00:17:36.780 --> 00:17:38.870
You'll get a cold if you stand out there.

00:17:38.870 --> 00:17:40.540
Come over here!

00:17:40.540 --> 00:17:42.040
Let's play!

00:17:42.040 --> 00:17:43.620
Sure!

00:17:46.250 --> 00:17:48.500
Mister, thanks!

00:17:48.500 --> 00:17:50.000
See you around!

00:17:51.840 --> 00:17:53.260
Yeah!

00:17:53.260 --> 00:17:54.800
Good luck, Kenta!

00:17:55.220 --> 00:17:58.600
Kenta, treasure your friends!

00:17:58.600 --> 00:18:00.600
Things will be peaceful now.

00:18:00.600 --> 00:18:04.680
A Charging Lady's job is really great.

00:18:04.680 --> 00:18:06.350
Thanks, Plug.

00:18:07.270 --> 00:18:09.020
Thanks, Alesta.

00:18:09.020 --> 00:18:10.190
Oh, no!

00:18:11.230 --> 00:18:12.480
Sentou?

00:18:12.480 --> 00:18:14.440
You can see us?

00:18:15.030 --> 00:18:15.900
Yeah.

00:18:16.530 --> 00:18:17.490
Really?

00:18:17.950 --> 00:18:18.410
Yeah.

00:18:20.370 --> 00:18:22.620
Don't you mess with me!

00:18:24.410 --> 00:18:27.670
I'd finally found a fun toy.

00:18:27.670 --> 00:18:29.630
I'm so very angry!

00:18:35.840 --> 00:18:38.550
Everyone's always getting in my way!

00:18:38.550 --> 00:18:40.600
Nobody messes with me!

00:18:40.600 --> 00:18:43.680
I've had enough. I'll destroy you all-

00:18:47.350 --> 00:18:49.060
Enough of this!

00:18:49.060 --> 00:18:50.770
You're causing trouble for people!

00:18:52.860 --> 00:18:55.530
If you're lonely, then just say so.

00:18:55.530 --> 00:18:57.200
I'll play with you anytime.

00:18:57.860 --> 00:19:01.450
But, if you want to play, play more like a kid.

00:19:01.450 --> 00:19:02.740
Got it?

00:19:04.410 --> 00:19:06.370
It was because...

00:19:07.540 --> 00:19:09.330
So, she really is just a kid after all.

00:19:09.330 --> 00:19:10.290
So it seems.

00:19:10.290 --> 00:19:13.500
So, the legendary special ability user...

00:19:13.500 --> 00:19:15.880
Now, now! It's all over!

00:19:15.880 --> 00:19:17.300
All's well that ends well.

00:19:17.300 --> 00:19:21.470
Hey, get away from Sentou!

00:19:22.680 --> 00:19:23.970
And several days later...

00:19:23.970 --> 00:19:28.600
Next is a report on the large-scale energy theft that occurred inside Neodym, Inc.

00:19:28.600 --> 00:19:30.440
According to a police press conference yesterday,

00:19:30.440 --> 00:19:33.190
the entire group responsible was arrested.

00:19:33.190 --> 00:19:38.570
Their ringleader was attempting to use this energy for personal gain...

00:19:40.530 --> 00:19:42.530
So that's how it ends, huh?

00:20:02.090 --> 00:20:03.850
Merry Christmas!

00:20:03.850 --> 00:20:06.010
Here's a present for you.

00:20:06.010 --> 00:20:08.350
Thanks for everything, Sentou.

00:20:08.350 --> 00:20:10.060
You, too.

00:20:10.060 --> 00:20:12.810
You're the best charging lady there is, Plug.

00:20:12.810 --> 00:20:17.690
No... Sentou, even if it's the truth, don't be so direct!

00:20:17.690 --> 00:20:19.490
Hold it, you!

00:20:19.900 --> 00:20:21.570
Please, take this.

00:20:21.570 --> 00:20:22.950
My love...

00:20:24.160 --> 00:20:25.660
Thank you.

00:20:25.660 --> 00:20:27.540
In return, then...

00:20:27.540 --> 00:20:31.460
...here is proof of my love!

00:20:37.340 --> 00:20:38.840
What are you two doing?

00:20:40.260 --> 00:20:42.510
N-Nothing, nothing...

00:20:42.510 --> 00:20:43.430
Really?

00:20:43.430 --> 00:20:44.390
Oh well.

00:20:44.390 --> 00:20:49.100
Anyway, would you do something about her?

00:20:49.100 --> 00:20:52.730
But you said you'd play with me as much as I wanted!

00:20:52.730 --> 00:20:55.060
Right? Sentou!

00:20:55.060 --> 00:20:59.400
Someone who got physical with her turned her into a good girl.

00:20:59.400 --> 00:21:02.820
Is it really okay for her to go unpunished?

00:21:02.820 --> 00:21:06.990
In the end, the mess she caused was due to a stranger,

00:21:06.990 --> 00:21:11.580
who told her that "the parallel world is fun place," and used her for the electricity theft.

00:21:11.580 --> 00:21:15.120
She's just an innocent kid.

00:21:15.120 --> 00:21:18.340
So, why are you here?

00:21:19.420 --> 00:21:20.630
Senny!

00:21:20.630 --> 00:21:22.920
The Christmas cake is done!

00:21:22.920 --> 00:21:24.260
Come on, Sentou!

00:21:24.260 --> 00:21:26.300
Let's party, already!

00:21:27.010 --> 00:21:28.390
Alright then!

00:21:31.520 --> 00:21:33.980
Merry Christmas!

00:21:35.230 --> 00:21:36.440
Yummy!

00:21:37.270 --> 00:21:39.400
This'll do.

00:21:42.690 --> 00:21:45.030
Merry Christmas!

00:22:09.050 --> 00:22:12.560
Honto wa totemo TOUGH nan da yo

00:22:09.050 --> 00:22:12.560
Really, I'm quite tough, you know

00:22:12.560 --> 00:22:15.350
Hitori demo heiki de

00:22:12.560 --> 00:22:15.350
I'm fine even all by myself

00:22:15.350 --> 00:22:18.100
Doko ni demo ikeru no

00:22:15.350 --> 00:22:18.100
I can go anywhere at all

00:22:18.100 --> 00:22:20.900
Koibito nante iranai

00:22:18.100 --> 00:22:20.900
I don't need a boyfriend or anything

00:22:20.900 --> 00:22:26.360
Takumashiku ikiteikunda to kimetetanda

00:22:20.900 --> 00:22:26.360
I decided that I would live strong

00:22:26.360 --> 00:22:28.160
Kimi to deau made wa

00:22:26.360 --> 00:22:28.160
Until the day I could meet you

00:22:33.370 --> 00:22:36.160
Sore wa arigachi na

00:22:33.370 --> 00:22:36.160
"That really is

00:22:36.160 --> 00:22:38.960
Warui kuse da yo

00:22:36.160 --> 00:22:38.960
It's a bad habit

00:22:38.960 --> 00:22:41.710
Hanashi janai ka? nante

00:22:38.960 --> 00:22:41.710
such an often-heard saying, right?"

00:22:41.710 --> 00:22:44.510
Toshiue buranaide ne

00:22:41.710 --> 00:22:44.510
Don't pretend to be older than you are

00:22:44.510 --> 00:22:49.680
Datte ne watashi wa itsumo tokubetsu

00:22:44.510 --> 00:22:49.680
But you know, I'm always an exceptional case

00:22:50.050 --> 00:22:52.810
Kimi ni mo kitto SPECIAL deshou

00:22:50.050 --> 00:22:52.810
I'm sure I'm special to you, too

00:22:52.810 --> 00:22:54.520
Sore de nakya iya

00:22:52.810 --> 00:22:54.520
I couldn't stand it any other way

00:22:54.890 --> 00:22:58.350
Zettai watashi soba ni iru yo

00:22:54.890 --> 00:22:58.350
I'll definitely always be beside you

00:22:58.350 --> 00:23:06.360
Kimi ga ochikondara namida fusegu kasa ni naritainda yo

00:22:58.350 --> 00:23:02.480
I want to become the umbrella

00:23:02.480 --> 00:23:06.360
that shields you from tears when you're feeling down

00:23:06.690 --> 00:23:11.950
Keredo mamoreteru no wa naze ka watashi bakari

00:23:06.690 --> 00:23:09.320
But why is it that I'm the one

00:23:09.320 --> 00:23:11.950
who always ends up being protected?

00:23:12.280 --> 00:23:18.250
Kimochi no naka no koishi ne tsumazuite korobisou na toki

00:23:12.280 --> 00:23:18.250
At the times when, in my heart, I stumble and seem about to fall

00:23:18.460 --> 00:23:22.960
Itsumo sotto sasaete kureru

00:23:18.460 --> 00:23:22.960
Keep supporting me just a little, always

00:23:23.340 --> 00:23:27.470
Futoshita kizuna itoshii yo

00:23:23.340 --> 00:23:27.470
I'll treasure this unexpected bond

00:23:27.470 --> 00:23:28.800
Itsumademo

00:23:27.470 --> 00:23:28.800
Now and forever

00:23:29.220 --> 00:23:33.050
Eien Sweetheart

00:23:29.220 --> 00:23:33.050
Eternally, Sweetheart

00:23:39.060 --> 00:23:41.980
Oh, my. You look down.

00:23:41.980 --> 00:23:45.860
You've just become a charging target!

00:23:45.860 --> 00:23:48.110
So, let's go!

00:23:48.110 --> 00:23:49.990
For the sake of your heart...

00:23:49.990 --> 00:23:56.660
Charge!

00:23:57.200 --> 00:23:58.710
Don't give up.

00:23:58.710 --> 00:24:00.120
The Charging Ladies

00:24:00.120 --> 00:24:04.170
will always be with you.
